WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,760
Now there are so many empty rooms in the community

2
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:06,020
If we recruit some more owners,

3
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:08,020
How much income do you need to increase every month?

4
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:09,620
Need to bring in some high-end customers

5
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:12,820
Go catch two more S-class weirdos and come in and become the owners.

6
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:36,020
I asked why the sparrows were chirping this morning

7
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:38,020
It turns out that Brother Yuan came to visit.
